Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:37:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Rust-side webview screenshot API (rebased #1674)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

`WebView::screenshot(handler)`: a PNG of the webview's visible region,
delivered to `handler`.

- macOS: `WKWebView takeSnapshotWithConfiguration:completionHandler:`
  (no screen-recording permission), NSBitmapImageRep → PNG.
- Windows: `ICoreWebView2::CapturePreview` into an SHCreateMemStream.
- Linux: `webkit_web_view_get_snapshot` (visible region) → pixbuf → PNG.
- iOS / Android: not yet.

This is tauri-apps/wry#1674 by @josh-richardson, merged onto current dev
(conflicts were only in import lists and the error enum), unchanged
otherwise. Related: #1358, prior art #266, #1258.
